            </note>
            <note corresp="#d340-f2" n="2" xml:id="d340-f2-content">
                <p>In telegram 1920, April 26, Parsons expressed concern that U.S. officials in Laos
                    were supporting a candidate for Prime Minister in contradiction to U.S.
                    guidelines. (<hi rendition="#italic">ibid</hi>., Central Files,
                    751J.13/4–2660)</p>
            </note>
